# derived projects. App.melt references `shared.Const`, so the frontend needs sharedJs on
# its classpath and the backend needs sharedJvm — otherwise these fail to resolve it.

# Frontend (Scala.js) links, resolving shared.Const from sharedJs (frontendDependsOn).
